  "text": "Short Pump Now Open | Virginia Veterinary Centers\nSkip to Primary Content\nFind a Location\nEmergency\nEmergency\nContact Us\nContact Us\nCareers\nBlog\nOnline Pharmacy\nAbout\nOur Story\nFind a Location\nOur Team\nShort Pump\nMidlothian\nFredericksburg\nView All Staff\nServices\nFredericksburg\nMidlothian\nShort Pump\nView all Services\nPet Owners\nEmergency Check-In\nBlog\nFAQs & Resources\nOnline Pharmacy\nFor Veterinarians\nReferral Information\nContinuing Education\nYour Referral Relationship Managers\nFAQs & Resources\nAccess Referral Portal\nAccess Referral Instructions\nFind a Location\nEmergency\nContact Us\nVVC Short Pump\nServices\nVirginia Veterinary Centers in Short Pump is a 24-hour emergency and specialty animal hospital serving Short Pump, Richmond, Henrico, and the surrounding areas. From sudden emergencies to advanced specialty care, our team is here to help pets receive the right care when they need it most.\nView Our Services Page >\nCritical Care\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nRadiology\nEmergency\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOncology\nSurgery\nAnesthesia\nHERE’S WHAT YOU WILL FIND AT OUR NEW FACILITY:\n32,000 sq. ft. emergency & specialty hospital\nDedicated parking lot\nLocated in the newly constructed Gateway Square Plaza – just a 20-minute drive from VVC’s Cary St. Hospital\nEasy access from VA-288 and I-64\n24/7 Emergency\nA dedicated Critical Care Unit (ICU) including high-flow oxygen and ventilators for our most critical patients\nDedicated Isolation Suites for both respiratory and GI infectious diseases\nSpecialty services include Anesthesiology, Critical Care, Dentistry, Internal Medicine, Medical Oncology, Ophthalmology, Radiation Oncology, Radiology, Surgery and Neurology & Neurosurgery services provided by our partners at Bush Veterinary Neurology Service (BVNS) Richmond\nDiagnostic capabilities include Digital Radiology, CT, Ultrasound, MRI, CT Cone Beam, Fluoroscopy\nLinac (Radiation Therapy)\nSeven state-of-the-art Surgery Suites\n31 ER Exam Rooms\nFull in-house lab\nOur New Location!\n4300 Greybull Drive Henrico, VA 23233-7667\nOUR CONSTRUCTION PROGRESS\nFollow Our Facebook!\nFacebook\nFind a Location\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nCareers\nBlog\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
